  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop SX 300 LS 2025 is a lightweight spin-oriented performance racquet featuring a 100 sq.in head, 285 g unstrung weight, 325 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern. It combines exceptional maneuverability, explosive spin and impressive comfort, making it an excellent choice for intermediate and advanced players seeking a fast-swinging modern racquet.",

    "zh": "Dunlop SX 300 LS 2025 是 SX 系列轻量级旋转型球拍，采用100平方英寸拍面、285克空拍重量、325毫米平衡点及16×19线床。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提供优秀的减震与回弹表现；SPIN BOOST XT GROMMETS 与 SPIN BOOST FRAME GEOMETRY 带来更强旋转和更高容错率；V-ENERGY SHAFT 提高挥拍速度与稳定性；VIBROSHIELD 则进一步提升舒适性。整体定位为轻量、高旋转、易挥拍，适合希望提升挥拍速度和旋转质量的中高级球员。"
  },

